# ── QA screenshots (regenerable, disposable) ──────────────────────────
# The Playwright harness writes screenshots into qa-*/ folders at the repo root.
# Every one is regenerated by re-running the script that produced it, so a single
# pattern covers them all. Listing each folder individually (39 entries, as this
# file used to) meant a new QA run leaked into git until someone remembered to
# add it.
qa-*/
